This repo answers one search: **how to play GTA 6 on a PC from Europe in 2026**, without waiting for a Windows SKU and without an emulator.

**GTA 6 Cloudplay** seats you on a licensed console in an operated bay. Video comes to your monitor. Controls go back from Windows. Frankfurt, Amsterdam, London, Paris, Warsaw, the Nordics, and the Baltics are built for EU last-mile — not a US GPU farm.

> Not affiliated with Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive, Microsoft, or Sony.
> Not a PC port, not GeForce Now running a missing executable, not a pirate build.

---

## If you are in Europe, start here

| You are in | Open this | Why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Germany | [Frankfurt hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/de/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-de#hall-frankfurt) | DE-CIX. Usually the cleanest Western Europe hop. |
