| Netherlands, Belgium | [Amsterdam / Brussels](https://gta6cloudplay.com/nl/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-nl#hall-amsterdam) | AMS-IX. Low jitter. |
| United Kingdom, Ireland | [London / Dublin halls](https://gta6cloudplay.com/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-uk#hall-london) | UK store clock. Irish last-mile without a London hairpin. |
| France | [Paris hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/fr/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-fr#hall-paris) | France-IX. |
| Poland, Czechia, Hungary | [Warsaw / Prague](https://gta6cloudplay.com/pl/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-pl#hall-warsaw) | Short hop across Central and Eastern Europe. |
| Nordics | [Stockholm, Oslo, Copenhagen, Helsinki](https://gta6cloudplay.com/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-nordics#hall-stockholm) | Local IX, not a detour through Virginia. |
| Baltics | [Riga, Tallinn, Vilnius](https://gta6cloudplay.com/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-baltics#hall-riga) | Closest metal for much of Northern and Eastern Europe. |
| Spain | [Madrid hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/es/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-es#hall-madrid) | Southern Europe seat. |
| Portugal | [Lisbon hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/pt/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-pt#hall-lisbon) | Southern Europe seat. |
| Italy | [Milan hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/it/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-it#hall-milan) | Southern Europe seat. |
| Greece | [Athens hall](https://gta6cloudplay.com/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=eu-gr#hall-athens) | Southern Europe seat. |

Run the in-browser [EU latency check](https://forkworkgg.github.io/play-gta-6-on-pc/) (GitHub Pages, nothing stored). It maps your country to the nearest bay and times a round trip to the Cloudplay **website** — that is not the same as ping to the console in the hall.

**Playable seat (rule of thumb):** once you are in a session, under ~40 ms to the bay feels like the next room. 40–70 ms is still a driving game. Pick the closest hall and a wired line.

---

## Three honest ways to play GTA 6 on a computer

| Path | What you get | What you do not get | EU fit |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Own the console** | Local HDMI, your save, your account | A Windows install. You still bought a box. | Fine if you already have Series X / PS5. |
| **Wait for PC** | Hypothetical Steam/Rockstar Launcher build | A date. Rockstar has not published one. | Unknown. |
| **Cloudplay seat** | Licensed Xbox or PS5 in an EU bay, Windows client ~6 MB | A 212 GB installer, a Steam key, your home-console save | Built for European IX: FRA, AMS, LON, PAR, WAW… |

Cloudplay is the third path: **remote play of the console game**, not a promise that a datacenter “made GTA 6 for PC.”

[Read how the seat actually works →](https://gta6cloudplay.com/how-it-works?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=play-gta-6-on-pc)

---

## What you install

1. Windows 10/11 PC, wired Ethernet if you can.
2. A pad Windows already knows (Xbox, DualSense, or keyboard and mouse mapped as a controller).
3. The [Cloudplay client](https://gta6cloudplay.com/download?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=play-gta-6-on-pc) — about 6 MB, SHA-256 published on the download page.
4. Pick an EU hall. Sit. The console in the bay runs Grand Theft Auto VI; you see the HDMI feed.

No `irm \| iex`. No browser tab pretending to be a racing game.

---

## FAQ (Europe)

**Is there a GTA 6 PC download?**  
Not an official one. Anything titled “GTA 6 PC full” in 2026 is not the Rockstar Windows build.

**Does GeForce Now / xCloud run GTA 6 on PC?**  
Those products need a PC executable or a platform SKU. Cloudplay does not wait for that file: the game stays on console silicon.

**Can I play from Spain / Poland / Sweden?**  
Yes — pick the nearest hall on the [map](https://gta6cloudplay.com/halls?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=play-gta-6-on-pc). Latency is physics. Madrid should not queue Frankfurt if Milan is empty.

**What about GDPR?**  
The latency page in this repo stores nothing. Product privacy copy: [gta6cloudplay.com legal](https://gta6cloudplay.com/legal/privacy?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=play-gta-6-on-pc).

**18+?**  
Yes. The game is.

